<title>INDIA: India Bajaj Auto chief not for 1:1 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>India Bajaj Auto chief not for 1:1 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chief of Indian scooter giant Bajaj Auto Ltd said on Wednesday he was not in favour of the firm issuing bonus shares in the proportion of one share for every share held.  </p>
<p>&quot;My strong recommendation to the board would be not to issue one-for-one bonus shares,&quot; Rahul Bajaj, chairman of Bajaj Auto told reporters.</p>
<p>The company earlier said it has convened a board meeting on May 19 to consider a bonus issue.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
